SUMMARY:Mystic Picnic! Raleigh area\, last chance for 2026
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nHalloween day\, co
 stumes optional! Do you enjoy spiritual growth? Are you having amazing exp
 eriences that you can’t talk about with most people? Join the club at th
 e Mystic Picnics at Lake Crabtree park in Morrisville NC.\n\nEvery last Sa
 turday at the Mystic Picnic from March to October\, we create a safe fun o
 utdoor space for meeting kindred souls and clarifying the concepts that se
 t us free in these ascension times when the realities are so clearly diver
 ging. Which parallel Earth are you from\, and what are you here to do?\n\n
 We share stories and support energy healing\, psychic gifts\, angels\, nat
 ure spirits\, ET helpers\, reincarnation\, lucid dreams\, and so much more
 . We keep it real\, grounded\, positive\, and heart-centered\, so folks ca
 n bring their genuine concerns without the big conspiracies. I’ve experi
 enced so many wonders myself\, so I’ll be hosting a main circle for frie
 ndly discussions. There will be potluck food and a nice grassy field for a
 ctivities.\n\nBring a chair if you have\, plus food or drink you want to s
 hare. I’ll supply cups\, plates\, napkins and utensils\, plus extra chai
 rs and snacks. We meet at Lake Crabtree park off Route 40 between Durham a
 nd Raleigh\, NC. Enter park from Aviation Parkway\, proceed to first parki
 ng lot on right. If lot is full\, drive to the next lot and walk back\, or
  wait as people come and go frequently. You’ll see me with some chairs n
 ear the lot (I’ll get the best spot available)\n\nRAIN LOCATION: If sign
 ificant rain we meet a half mile north\, across highway 40 to the RDU Gall
 eria on the right. They have a big food court with outdoor covered seating
  area. Bring less stuff then\, we mostly have to buy their food.\n\nRe-mem
 ber. You matter. Time and space are rituals. You decide your own future. Y
 our imagination is the doorway. Your consciousness creates your own realit
 y.\n\n"I was alive and I waited for this. Right here\, right now\, there i
 s no other place I wanna be. Watching the world wake up from history."\n\\
 -\\- Jesus Jones video: [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GNJpLU8qcx8](http
 s://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GNJpLU8qcx8)\n\n"There's a starman waiting in 
 the sky. He's told us not to blow it 'cause he knows it's all worthwhile."
 \n\\-\\- astral David Bowie saves the world in January's stunning 10 year 
 tribute video: [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZcC0QWsfpAQ](https://www.y
 outube.com/watch?v=ZcC0QWsfpAQ)\n\nMy name is Carl and I’m cross-posting
  this event in several meetups for maximum networking fun. To see our spir
 itual meetup events [www.meetup.com/inner-selves-for-outer-mastery/](http:
 //www.meetup.com/inner-selves-for-outer-mastery/) YouTube channel [https:/
 /www.youtube.com/@InnerSelvesMastery](https://www.youtube.com/@InnerSelves
 Mastery) and newsletter [www.SignupISM.com](http://www.SignupISM.com) Ever
 yone is welcome to also join and post their own spiritual community events
  at [https://www.meetup.com/starseedsofraleigh/](https://www.meetup.com/st
 arseedsofraleigh/)\n\nbest wishes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nSpiritual Teac
 hing and Life Coaching\n[www.InnerSelvesMastery.com](http://www.InnerSelve
 sMastery.com)\nquick links: [www.SignupISM.com](http://www.SignupISM.com)
