SUMMARY:Halloween Get-together
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n🖤 The veil is t
 hinning. The spirits are stirring. And the night belongs to the dead.\nAs 
 October draws to a close\, the boundary between worlds grows thin.\nThis S
 amhain\, we gather beneath the watchful eyes of the crows to honor old tra
 ditions\, embrace a little mystery\, and raise a glass to the living and t
 he dead. 🕯️\nJoin us Saturday\, October 31\, for Samhain Murder at El
 ixir VI\, beginning at 7 PM.\nExpect curious fortunes\, mysterious exchang
 es\, traditional Irish barmbrack\, and a little magic to carry into the da
 rker half of the year.\n🍂 Some traditions are worth keeping alive.\nFor
  more info on the venue: [https://elixirvi.com/](https://elixirvi.com/)\n
 📍 425 E\\. Main St\\. \\| Clayton\\\, NC
