SUMMARY:Get Unstuck: Why Change Seemed Hard When It's Really Easy
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nCongratulations! Y
 ou’re on the path of self-improvement with a long list of changes you ho
 pe to make to get the life you always wanted. But that idealistic to-do li
 st can inspire and excite you\, or make you anxious and depressed. Is it t
 oo much to ask for everything from inner peace to world peace\, with lots 
 of love\, health\, wealth and fun times in between? Why is change so hard\
 , especially in a society where so many people seem content to settle for 
 daily violence\, ignorance\, and self-serving survivalism? Well\, you’re
  not alone in the struggle to stay optimistic in these challenging times. 
 You just need some key insights on how to get unstuck when you’re actual
 ly on the threshold of breakthroughs. Join us Sunday Nov 1\, 2026 for a fr
 ee liberating talk on how to see the fabulous growth you’ve already made
 \, so you can relax and let more changes happen to live happy ever after.\
 n\nThese are the ascension times\, and knowing what that means can make al
 l the difference. Now is time to become the creator of your own life as yo
 u live it\, so that you no longer have to die to go to heaven. The traditi
 onal model of achievement was based on divine rewards and punishments. Ple
 ase God in life and get rewarded in the afterlife. Suffer graciously\, sac
 rifice\, don’t complain. To this day\, many people still work hard and s
 truggle for later rewards. Even if they don’t believe in a parental God\
 , they still believe in employers\, economies\, and rules to satisfy to co
 llect their benefits someday. Rebels who steal and dominate may seem power
 ful\, but they’re actually so weak that they believe in rules by which t
 hey can never win. People who really know how to succeed in life become ki
 nd and generous.\n\nAscension means you stop waiting for someone else to f
 ix your life someday\, and start living your own future now. Be in the wor
 ld but not of it\; think and feel from the vision that you hold. The quali
 ty of your journey is the destination that you seek\, so if you don’t li
 ke how you’re living then you’re the only one who can change your own 
 experience. Change is hard when you don’t understand how the living lovi
 ng Universe works to always support your personal lifestyle. There’s not
 hing more powerful than how you choose to be. Don’t focus on what you do
 \, focus on how you do everything that you do. Your state of being leads n
 aturally to what you can and will do next. The changes you desire are alre
 ady happening at every level of reality itself. Deep down every human bein
 g is good and just wants a good life. How you let this happen is what must
  be learned. The gods help those who help themselves.\n\nSo while Earth li
 fe is extremely challenging\, that challenge doesn’t have to be hard. Ma
 ny people today are feeling challenged as if they’re being attacked on a
  battlefield. They react accordingly and out of control\, causing harm to 
 others and themselves. Instead\, you can feel challenged like learning a w
 hole new way to live in the best total immersion college course. Every day
  is a new exciting lesson in how to be more confident and happy than the d
 ay before. Whichever attitude you hold\, you will get more of what you exp
 ect. Contrary to popular belief\, other people are not affecting you\, onl
 y you affect yourself. If you let other people exist exactly as they choos
 e in order to inform you by their examples of possible choices and consequ
 ences\, then you alone can decide most consciously what’s best for you.\
 n\nFor this meetup\, review your wish list for your life. Have the courage
  to go beyond the inner critics that say you failed just to make you feel 
 bad about yourself. We’ll see how belief systems work to help you manife
 st the life that you deep down know you still deserve. Weak people like to
  think that everything should be just right for them\, so they waste their
  time and energy on trying to control and change the world instead of chan
 ging themselves. That’s ok\, we can all learn to forgive and change. Fal
 se negative beliefs say that change is hard\, requiring endless subconscio
 us perfection. That way you’ll always fail\, never change\, and feed the
  negative energy with your own hurt stuck emotions. True positive beliefs 
 explain what you’ve already done good enough to build upon\, so your con
 sciousness is all you ever need. We’ll study the four levels of changes 
 that you must understand to bust every old pattern\, and conclude with a g
 uided meditation to invite more divine support for your dreams. The Source
  wants you to be happy and fulfilled for the highest good of all.\n\nWelco
 me! Our Inner Selves Mastery spiritual support group is free online every 
 Sunday 11am-130pm EDT\, with the last 30 minutes for a guided meditation. 
 If you can’t stay you can get the recording. You can signup here for thi
 s meeting and visit www.signupISM.com for all events\, newsletter\, videos
 \, and more.\n\nBest wishes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nInner Selves Mastery
 \nspiritual teaching and coaching\nquick-links at www.signupISM.com
