SUMMARY:Salsa in Black - November Birthday celebration  - Latin dance soci
 al!
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n🔥 SALSA4LIFE WE
 DNESDAYS 🔥\nCelebrating November Birthdays!\nDress in black!\n\nSALSA 
 • BACHATA • MERENGUE • LATIN HITS\nCary’s Wednesday night Latin da
 nce social is where the community comes together to DANCE! 💃🏽🕺
 🏽\n🔥 WEEKLY LATIN DANCE SOCIAL\n🔥 BEGINNER-FRIENDLY DANCE LESSON\
 n🔥 SPACIOUS DANCE FLOOR\n🔥 COOL A/C + COMFORTABLE DANCE SPACE + FANS
 \n🔥 DRINK SPECIALS 🍻\n🔥 FREE PARKING\n🔥 DOOR PRIZE GIVEAWAYS 
 🎁\n🔥 COME SOLO OR BRING YOUR CREW\n🔥 GREAT MUSIC • GREAT PEOPLE
  • LATIN DANCING\nWhether you're brand new to Latin dancing or you've be
 en dancing Salsa and Bachata for years\, Salsa4Life Wednesdays is your mid
 week dance destination!\nCome learn\, meet new people\, connect with the c
 ommunity\, and dance the night away. ❤️\n🔥 YOUR WEDNESDAY NIGHT PLA
 NS ARE HERE! 🔥\n⏰ 7:15 PM — Doors open & meet-and-greet mixer\n💃
 🏽 7:30–8:30 PM — Salsa & Bachata lesson\n🎁 After class — Free 
 door prize giveaways\n🔥 8:30–11:00 PM — Social dancing\n\n🕺 DJ G
 iovanni playing the best 🎶 Salsa\, Bachata\, Merengue and Latin Hits.\n
 📍 KōMANA Brewing Company\n1020 Ryan Road\, Cary\, NC\n💵 $10 online 
 and b4 9pm\nTickets: salsa4life.com\n\n🍻 Drink specials available\nNo p
 artner needed. All levels welcome.\n18+ to party • 21+ to drink\n\n🔥 
 MAKE WEDNESDAY YOUR NEW FAVORITE NIGHT TO DANCE!\n📤 SHARE with someone 
 who needs more dancing in their life!\nHosted by Salsa4Life.com\n\n#Salsa4
 Life #Salsa4LifeWednesdays #LatinDance #SalsaDancing #BachataDancing #Mere
 ngue #LatinMusic #CaryNC #RaleighNC #TriangleNC
